      Line":{"$content":"Ok, but I strongly recommend that you reduce your heartbeat
      because it can negatively impact the decisions you make.","$type":"System.String"},"Character":{"$content":5,"$type":"UnityEngine.Object"},"Text1":{"$content":"Ok,
      I''ll track my heart rate and ask you for help if things get worse.","$type":"System.String"},"Text2":{"$content":"I\u2019ll
      try to calm down and think of something peaceful and hopeful. ","$type":"System.String"},"Text3":{"$content":"Thanks.
      I\u2019ll be fine - my heart rate won\u2019t affect what I do. ","$type":"System.String"},"Text4":{"$content":"Got
